[    0.000000] Linux version 6.8.0-147-generic (buildd@lcy02-amd64-081) (x86_64-linux-gnu-gcc-13 (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0, GNU ld (GNU Binutils for Ubuntu) 2.42) #147-Ubuntu SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu Sep 24 11:33:16 UTC 2026 (Ubuntu 6.8.0-147.147-generic 6.8.12)
